tax shall not be\napplicable to a permanent resident of a hotel or motel.\n\nRequested by the Town of Gardiner Town Board by resolution adopted on\nApril 7, 2026.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew bill\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone to the state\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately and shall expire after three\nyears.\n",
